1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:03,160
Allah bagi keamanan, bagi keselamatan.

2
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:09,750
Kita, Allah bagi kita hidup, ni dah?

3
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,980
Sampai umur 50, 60.

4
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:16,260
Ni Pulau Pisang tadi, 40 dah meninggal.

5
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:17,810
Muda lagi.

6
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:21,570
Kita, Allah bagi panjang umur.

7
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:23,700
Allah pelihara kita.

8
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,460
Jantung kita berdegup sentiasa.

9
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:30,690
Masa malam ke, masa siang ke,

10
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:34,220
masa tidur ke, Allah pelihara kita

11
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,140
24 jam.

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:39,060
Setiap detik, setiap saat hidup.

13
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:41,730
Mak bapak kita pun tak pelihara

14
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,980
kita macam Allah pelihara kita.

15
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:46,540
Kalau Allah Ta'ala kata, eh cukup

16
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,900
dah, tak payahlah berdegup jantung,

17
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,300
matilah kita.

18
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,740
Suami kita pun tak sayang

19
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:55,080
sebagaimana Allah sayang kita.

20
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:56,280
Allah bagi peluang.

21
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,770
Allah pelihara kita.

22
00:00:57,770 --> 00:01:00,560
Jadi kenapa kita tak sayang Allah?

23
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:04,050
Kenapa kita tak syukur kepada Allah?

24
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:06,550
Dia yang bagi kurnia berbagai-bagai

25
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:08,290
kepada kita.
